#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:11
msgid "5 · Check convergence"
msgstr "5 · Memeriksa konvergensi"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:13
msgid "Decide whether the chains have converged."
msgstr "Putuskan apakah rantai sudah konvergen."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:15
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need a fitted model from {doc}`04-fit-model`:"
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan model yang sudah di-fit dari {doc}`04-fit-model`:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:28
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:35
msgid "The R-style alias `hbcc` is the same function. The call also draws trace, density, autocorrelation, R-hat, ESS and energy plots. The pair plot marks divergent transitions; it is slow, so request it explicitly:"
msgstr "Alias gaya R `hbcc` adalah fungsi yang sama. Pemanggilan ini juga menggambar plot trace, densitas, autokorelasi, R-hat, ESS, dan energi. Pair plot menandai transisi divergen; plot ini lambat, jadi minta secara eksplisit:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:43
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:45
msgid "A value outside these limits raises a `ConvergenceWarning`."
msgstr "Nilai di luar batas berikut memunculkan `ConvergenceWarning`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Diagnostic"
msgstr "Diagnostik"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Acceptable"
msgstr "Dapat diterima"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "If not"
msgstr "Jika tidak"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "R-hat"
msgstr "R-hat"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "≤ 1.01"
msgstr "≤ 1.01"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "The chains explored different regions"
msgstr "Rantai menjelajahi wilayah yang berbeda"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Bulk ESS"
msgstr "Bulk ESS"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "≥ 100 × chains (400 with the default 4)"
msgstr "≥ 100 × rantai (400 dengan default 4)"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Too few effective draws for the posterior centre"
msgstr "Terlalu sedikit draw efektif untuk bagian tengah posterior"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Tail ESS"
msgstr "Tail ESS"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "≥ 100 × chains"
msgstr "≥ 100 × rantai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "The credible intervals are unreliable"
msgstr "Interval kredibel tidak dapat diandalkan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Divergences"
msgstr "Divergensi"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Draws near the divergence are biased"
msgstr "Draw di sekitar divergensi bias"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Tree depth hits"
msgstr "Tree depth maksimum tercapai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "Trajectories were cut short, so exploration is slow"
msgstr "Lintasan terpotong, sehingga eksplorasi lambat"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "E-BFMI"
msgstr "E-BFMI"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "≥ 0.3 in every chain"
msgstr "≥ 0.3 di setiap rantai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md
msgid "The sampler moves poorly between energy levels"
msgstr "Sampler sulit berpindah antartingkat energi"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:56
msgid "Check every row. A good R-hat with a poor tail ESS means the point estimate is stable but its interval is not."
msgstr "Periksa setiap baris. R-hat yang baik dengan tail ESS yang buruk berarti estimasi titiknya stabil tetapi intervalnya tidak."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:59
msgid "`diag.rhat_ess` holds the values per parameter, `diag.diagnose` the sampler-level counts, and `diag.ess_threshold` the ESS limit that was applied."
msgstr "`diag.rhat_ess` memuat nilai per parameter, `diag.diagnose` memuat hitungan tingkat sampler, dan `diag.ess_threshold` memuat batas ESS yang dipakai."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:62
msgid "`ConvergenceWarning` is a `UserWarning`, not an `HBSAEError`:"
msgstr "`ConvergenceWarning` adalah `UserWarning`, bukan `HBSAEError`:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:71
msgid "`except HBSAEError` therefore does not catch it. Use `warnings.catch_warnings` to handle it in code."
msgstr "Karena itu `except HBSAEError` tidak menangkapnya. Gunakan `warnings.catch_warnings` untuk menanganinya di kode."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Converged:** continue to {doc}`07-check-fit-and-compare`."
msgstr "**Konvergen:** lanjutkan ke {doc}`07-check-fit-and-compare`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Not converged:** refit with {doc}`06-update-model`, then check again."
msgstr "**Tidak konvergen:** lakukan fitting ulang dengan {doc}`06-update-model`, lalu periksa lagi."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:77
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:79
msgid "Change one setting at a time, in this order, and refit after each change:"
msgstr "Ubah satu pengaturan setiap kali, dengan urutan ini, dan lakukan fitting ulang setelah setiap perubahan:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:81
msgid "**`target_accept`** to 0.95, then 0.99. The sampler takes smaller steps, which removes divergences."
msgstr "**`target_accept`** ke 0.95, lalu 0.99. Sampler mengambil langkah yang lebih kecil, sehingga divergensi hilang."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:83
msgid "**`tune`**. More warm-up before the draws that count."
msgstr "**`tune`**. Warm-up lebih panjang sebelum draw yang dihitung."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:84
msgid "**`draws`**. Only after the first two."
msgstr "**`draws`**. Hanya setelah dua langkah pertama."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If none of these work, the problem is the model: too many hyperparameters for the number of areas, a group with a single observation, or two nearly collinear auxiliary variables. Go back to {doc}`02-specify-model`."
msgstr "Jika semua itu tidak berhasil, masalahnya ada pada model: terlalu banyak hiperparameter untuk jumlah area yang ada, grup dengan satu observasi saja, atau dua variabel penyerta yang hampir kolinear. Kembali ke {doc}`02-specify-model`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:90
msgid "**A plot is missing.** The reason is stored in `diag.plot_errors`. The diagnostics are still returned."
msgstr "**Plot tidak muncul.** Alasannya disimpan di `diag.plot_errors`. Hasil diagnostik tetap dikembalikan."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:93
msgid "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Fit the model first."
msgstr "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Lakukan fitting model terlebih dahulu."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:95
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/05-check-convergence.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why convergence is checked before any estimate is read: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."
msgstr "Mengapa konvergensi diperiksa sebelum estimasi apa pun dibaca: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."

